{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate islands and build cute cat cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kity Builder is a playful city-building sandbox about building settlements and cities for cats! Create beautiful settlements on different-sized and themed islands and watch as \u2018kitizens\u2019 move in and make themselves at home.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/f11d160b44851d7f9613e6ddd547abae.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every building is a toy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings double as toys to help you further explore the island. Climb, jump, and fling yourself through the air on a quest to discover every hidden nook and cranny. Collect blue(paw)prints and unlock new things to build. And don\u2019t worry, you\u2019re not alone \u2013 you\u2019ll have help from Mayor Mewyor, alongside a cast of strange, loveable kitties!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No limits. No pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without time limits, resources or even money, Kity Builder is all about the pure fun of creating. Move at your own pace and watch your city grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a city for kitties in an adorable island sandbox!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce and leap to new heights as you explore the island!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a zany cast of cat-characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create to your heart\u2019s content without timers or restrictions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat puns! Endless, endless cat puns!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"To the stars and beyond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622310/b09fab096c9975643026633913223ea5d0ac628b.jpg"},{"name":"The Buffed Fairy Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1622310/aa28d86ef51dd067d47e546249be8daaaf2c0250.jpg"},{"name":"The Mad Scientist Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu