/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/77cdf417671bda1db2f8bf1ad18147c4.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No limits. No pressure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without time limits, resources or even money, Kity Builder is all about the pure fun of creating. Move at your own pace and watch your city grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.poster.avif?t=1750757386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.webm?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1622310/extras/3ff6e5b6a4659e0c7caf10621da104ad.mp4?t=1750757386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a city for kitties in an adorable island sandbox!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, bounce and leap to new heights as you explore the island!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a zany cast of cat-characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create to your heart\u2019s content without timers or restrictions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat puns! Endless, endless cat puns!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sambero","irx99","YerayToledano","Juan Hust"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.st